 "display": "4.0 : 1", "took": true}, {"param": "gain", "param_id": 2, "requested_value": 0.5333333333333333, "new_value": 0.533333, "display": "2.0 dB", "took": true}, {"param": "attack", "param_id": 3, "requested_value": 0.025, "new_value": 0.025, "display": "10.0 ms", "took": true}, {"param": "release", "param_id": 4, "requested_value": 0.03, "new_value": 0.030008, "display": "121 ms", "took": true}, {"param": "knee", "param_id": 5, "requested_value": 0.0, "new_value": 0.0, "display": "Hard", "took": true}], "threshold_db": -14, "ratio": 4, "gain_db": 2, "attack_ms": 10, "release_ms": 120, "knee": "hard"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'text': "All 6 parameters landed perfectly. Here's the summary:\n\n| Parameter | Value |\n|-----------|-------|\n| Threshold | −14 dB |\n| Ratio | 4:1 |\n| Attack | 10 ms |\n| Release | 121 ms *(~120 ms, rounding to nearest step)* |\n| Makeup Gain | +2 dB |\n| Knee | Hard |\n\nThis is a solid bass comp setting — 4:1 with a hard knee will clamp transients cleanly, 10 ms attack lets the initial note attack punch through before the comp kicks in, and 120 ms release gives the notes room to breathe between hits. The +2 dB makeup compensates for the gain reduction. Let me know if you want to tighten or loosen anything.", 'type': 'text'}, {'id': 'toolu_016eGhQPq3PjnmeRLaMTajUV', 'caller': {'type': 'direct'}, 'input': {'entry': '- Bass (track 8) Fruity Compressor (slot 0) set: threshold −14 dB, ratio 4:1, attack 10 ms, release ~121 ms, makeup +2 dB, hard knee. User-requested. All 6 params accepted.'}, 'name': 'write_history_entry', 'type': 'tool_use'}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_016eGhQPq3PjnmeRLaMTajUV', 'content': '{"ok": true, "timestamp": "## 2026-04-29 13:56 UTC", "path": "C:\\\\Users\\\\Chapo\\\\StudioMind\\\\projects\\\\projectmind\\\\.studiomind\\\\history.md"}'}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Sidechain the kick to the bass.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'id': 'too